Delay 46 ms
WheelUp 1
Delay 310 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 s
LeftUp 1
Delay 108 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
RightDown 1
Delay 64
RightUp 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 1000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>